#
# Must run from a plain terminal with NO local-model Claude session on port 8000: the serve
# scripts call gpu_exclusive.sh and will kill it (plan hard constraint).
#
# Behaviour baked in (no hand-editing needed):
#   * CONTINUE-ON-FAILURE: a server that fails to start is recorded and the run moves on.
#   * SUBSET / SHORT runs: ONLY='glob,..' picks probes; REPS=/MAX_TOKENS= shorten a pass.
